{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"24":"Wages (Kitab Al-Ijarah)"},"section_detail":{"24":{"hadithnumber_first":3416,"hadithnumber_last":3570,"arabicnumber_first":3416,"arabicnumber_last":3570,"name_native":"كتاب الإجارة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3475,"arabicnumber":3475,"text":"حدثنا عثمان بن ابي شيبة، حدثنا جرير، عن الاعمش، باسناده ومعناه قال \" ولا يزكيهم ولهم عذاب اليم \" . وقال في السلعة \" بالله لقد اعطي بها كذا وكذا فصدقه الاخر فاخذها","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (2672) Sahih Muslim (108)"}],"reference":{"book":24,"hadith":60}}]}